**Example Usage**

Here's an example of how you can use the `UrlParser` class to parse a URL:

```java
public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
    UrlParser parser = new UrlParser();
    String url = "http://a.com?b=1#c";
    String host = parser.getHost(url);
    String path = parser.getPath(url);
    String query = parser.getQuery(url);
    String fragment = parser.getFragment(url);

    System.out.println("Host: " + host);
    System.out.println("Path: " + path);
    System.out.println("Query: " + query);
    System.out.println("Fragment: " + fragment);
}
```

